WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.100
Lest We Forget.

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:04.912
How Canada Betrayed Its Veterans.

00:00:04.912 --> 00:00:08.537
They were promised a country worthy of their sacrifice.

00:00:08.537 --> 00:00:14.337
They were given a backlog, a budget cut, and a brochure for medical assistance in dying.
